<view class="page"><view class="card"><text class="heading">知识点评分证据</text><text>依据与学生报告固定到同一快照。作答、评分、证据资格和掌握结论是不同事实。</text><button bindtap="load" disabled="{{busy}}">重新核对此快照</button><button bindtap="back" disabled="{{busy}}">返回当前班级报告</button></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" role="alert">{{error}}<button bindtap="login">核对身份</button></view>
  <block wx:if="{{head && point}}"><view wx:if="{{taskTitle}}" class="card"><text class="heading">仅本次测评：{{taskTitle}}</text><text>上方掌握信号按整个报告窗口计算，下面评分依据仅限此测评。</text></view><view class="card"><text class="heading">{{person.name}} · {{point.code}} · {{point.name}}</text><text>{{head.className}} · {{head.subject}} · {{head.book}}</text><text>快照第 {{head.snapshotGeneration}} 代 · {{head.calculated}}</text><text>{{point.label}} · {{point.ratio}}（{{point.obtained}} / {{point.max}}）</text><text>有效独立题 {{point.independent}} 道 · 测评 {{point.assessments}} 次</text><text wx:if="{{point.state === 0}}">“未测评”表示当前口径下暂无有效独立证据；练习和确认分数仍是独立事实。</text><text class="notice">{{head.warning}}</text></view>
    <view class="card" wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><text class="heading">{{item.task}}</text><text>{{item.reason}}</text><text>本知识点分配得分 {{item.obtained}} / {{item.max}}</text><text>有效提交 {{item.at}}</text><text class="muted">该条分数不一定计入独立证据，是否纳入以上方原因和报告规则为准。</text><button wx:if="{{canReview}}" bindtap="review" data-id="{{item.id}}" disabled="{{busy}}">复制这条评分证据的网页复核地址</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{!rows.length && !busy}}" class="card"><text>此知识点没有已确认评分依据；这不表示零分。</text></view><text wx:if="{{canReview}}" class="muted">网页需要本人登录并重新核验当前评分；手机查看或复制不改变证据资格。</text><view class="pager"><button bindtap="paginate" data-direction="-1" disabled="{{busy || offset === 0}}">上一页依据</button><text>{{offset + rows.length}} / {{total}}</text><button bindtap="paginate" data-direction="1" disabled="{{busy || offset + 20 >= total}}">下一页依据</button></view>
  </block>
</view>
